  "label": "Ableism",
  "description": "The meme promotes ableism by mocking mental illness, which is a form of discrimination against people with disabilities or mental health conditions. Ableism involves the belief that people with mental disorders are inferior, burdensome, or less capable, and this meme trivializes their experiences by framing mental disorders as something to be laughed at.",
